The '''Builder''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Builder's House}} within the {{Zone|Village}}. They sell a wide variety of decorative blocks.

== Mechanics ==
=== Stranded ===
On the {{Gamemode|Stranded}} game mode, players can unlock the '''Builder''' by unlocking every collection, with the exception of a few collections that are unobtainable on Stranded.

Once the requirement is met, the '''Builder''' is permanently unlocked, even if new collections are added to the game in the future.

