== Trivia ==
*The '''Builder'''{{'}}s appearance bears a striking resemblance to [https://equestripedia.org/wiki/Flim_Flam_Brothers_(Friendship_is_Magic) Flim and Flam] from the My Little Pony series, which could indicate them being an inspiration.
*The '''Builder'''{{'}}s dialogue, '''"If you build, they will come!"''', is likely a reference to the 1989 film ''[[W:Field_of_Dreams|Field of Dreams]]'', in which the phrase '''"If you build it, he will come"''' is repeated.
*The list of collections which are unobtainable on {{Gamemode|Stranded}} used to be manually maintained, which has resulted in updates adding new collections preventing Stranded players from unlocking the '''Builder''' on several occasions. Eventually, the requirement was removed entirely.

